","$L2",null,{"href":"/hi/saints","className":"hover:text-amber-400 transition-colors","children":"संत"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"→"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"text-white/80 font-medium truncate","children":"श्री बिहारिन देव , श्री बिहारिन देव जू की वाणी, सिद्धान्त की साखी (333)"}]]}],["$","$L3",null,{"children":["$","$L4",null,{"initialSaint":{"name":"श्री बिहारिन देव , श्री बिहारिन देव जू की वाणी, सिद्धान्त की साखी (333)","hinglishName":"shri biharin dev , shri biharin dev ju ki vani, siddhant ki sakhi (333)","slug":"shri-biharin-dev-shri-biharin-dev-ju-ki-vani-siddhant-ki-sakhi-333","biography":"","metadata":null,"imageUrl":null,"verses":[{"id":"local-608","title":"जा रज सौं जग रज कहै","category":"Shloka","sanskrit_text":"जा रज सौं जग रज कहै, सो रज कज है जाइ।साँची रजहि न सेवहीं, श्री वृन्दावन आई॥","hindi_text":"प्रायः जीव संसारी माया की तलाश में कहाँ-कहाँ जाता है और दिन-रात प्रयत्न करता है, एवं माया-रूपी रज का ही सेवन करता है जो अहंकार को पुष्ट करती है। परन्तु दूसरी ओर वृन्दावन की रज (अर्थात् श्री प्रिया जी के चरणों की रज) है, जिसका सेवन करने से दिव्य प्रेम प्राप्त होता है, उसका जीव सेवन नहीं करता।","english_text":null,"english_translation":"According to Śrī Bihāriṇ Dev, the money is just like dust, which increases ego, and to attain that dust, a soul is working day and night. However, the soul doesn't desire the holy dust of Vṛndāvana (Dust of Śrī Rādhā's lotus feet), which is fully surcharged with the divine love.","description":"https://www.brajrasik.org/hi/articles/5b161bac9f7ab760360f9c7b/ja-raja-son-jag-raj-kahey-so-raj-kaj-hai-jai-sanchi-ranjhi-na-sewahin-shri-vrindavan-aai-shri-biharin-dev-biharin-dev-ki-vani","author":"श्री बिहारिन देव जी, श्री बिहारिन देव जू की वाणी, सिद्धान्त की साखी (333)","status":"published","content_text":"जा रज सौं जग रज कहै, सो रज कज है जाइ।\nसाँची रजहि न सेवहीं, श्री वृन्दावन आई॥\n- श्री बिहारिन देव जी, श्री बिहारिन देव जू की वाणी, सिद्धान्त की साखी (333)\nप्रायः जीव संसारी माया की तलाश में कहाँ-कहाँ जाता है और दिन-रात प्रयत्न करता है, एवं माया-रूपी रज का ही सेवन करता है जो अहंकार को पुष्ट करती है। परन्तु दूसरी ओर वृन्दावन की रज (अर्थात् श्री प्रिया जी के चरणों की रज) है, जिसका सेवन करने से दिव्य प्रेम प्राप्त होता है, उसका जीव सेवन नहीं करता।","tags":["Braj Rasik","Mass Import"],"image_urls":[],"video_urls":[],"media_links":[],"source_url":"https://www.brajrasik.org/hi/articles/5b161bac9f7ab760360f9c7b/ja-raja-son-jag-raj-kahey-so-raj-kaj-hai-jai-sanchi-ranjhi-na-sewahin-shri-vrindavan-aai-shri-biharin-dev-biharin-dev-ki-vani","slug":"ja-raj-saun-jag-raj-kahai"}],"books":[],"rawItem":null}}]}]],null],null],null]},[null,["$","$L5",null,{"parallelRouterKey":"children","segmentPath":["children","hi","children","saints","children","$6","children"],"error":"$undefined","errorStyles":"$undefined","errorScripts":"$undefined","template":["$","$L7",null,{}],"templateStyles":"$undefined","templateScripts":"$undefined","notFound":"$undefined","notFoundStyles":"$undefined"}]],null]},[null,["$","$L5",null,{"parallelRouterKey":"children","segmentPath":["children","hi","children","saints","children"],"error":"$undefined","errorStyles":"$undefined","errorScripts":"$undefined","template":["$","$L7",null,{}],"templateStyles":"$undefined","templateScripts":"$undefined","notFound":"$undefined","notFoundStyles":"$undefined"}]],null]},[[null,["$","div",null,{"lang":"hi","children":["$","$L5",null,{"parallelRouterKey":"children","segmentPath":["children","hi","children"],"error":"$undefined","errorStyles":"$undefined","errorScripts":"$undefined","template":["$","$L7",null,{}],"templateStyles":"$undefined","templateScripts":"$undefined","notFound":"$undefined","notFoundStyles":"$undefined"}]}]],null],null]},[[[["$","link","0",{"rel":"stylesheet","href":"/_next/static/css/cbf73327883ccb7f.css","precedence":"next","crossOrigin":"$undefined"}],["$","link","1",{"rel":"stylesheet","href":"/_next/static/css/fe995a1e4635138b.css","precedence":"next","crossOrigin":"$undefined"}],["$","link","2",{"rel":"style